<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Kar Meng</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kar Meng</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kar Meng</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kar Meng</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow risi Jeremia chekhai, now arui khin dow 586-585 BC takra kowi chekhai. Jeremia dow aia maru Judauüa tut-e kowh Thurai satang phuang mih chekhai. Mami dow 586 BC khe kowh Jerusalem marow tapiak mih lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jerusalem dow Juda pren kowi kowh marow kri chekhai. Jerusalem marow dow 586 BC khe Babulawnuüa uang piakta khai. Jerusalem marow kowi Zaiawn pami hungh uowi lowk. Nami hungh kowi dow Thurai chup kim uowi chekhai. Zaiawn hungh kowi kowh Thurai chup kim paw ransu-uüa piakta pe khai. Naiawngün piak mih dow risi Jeremia tawi khi khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami dow aia rik phuangta khowk mih lai uang tachi kowh aia awmrawm mih lawnguan nadowi. Mami dow aia maru-uüa ngah lai rakowi aia rik phuangta khowk iawng CHAKRAMANG ripra Jerusalem luk kowi akraingma uang towm mih lawnguan chekhai. Jerusalem piak mih aia sak kowi rau lai kowh piak mih lawnguan kar se meng hown aia tekah khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jerusalem marow kowi dow Juda, Israel, Jakawb, Zaiawn pahai mami bowih kowi risi Jeremia rükah khai. Nami klen kowi malauüa klangiungma mih hai masiuüa ngakma mih hown aia tuah khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jerusalem marow dow piak khai bowt, aia maru-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG ripra kowi uowi khai bowt. Amatni dow ransu-uüa dawng kowi cham takhang khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw mami bowih kowi kowh auan lang pankri mih dow (Kar Meng 3:22-23) kowi risi Jeremia tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG sakraura achur uowi dowi mih rakowi anging tapiak dowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia sanara dow katpaw achur uowi dowi chekhai. Aia kowh sanara dow rau towng asar hown uang tatüng reng, aia kowh kaah sakowm mih dow akraingma chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng kowh chownglawng kowi akrat pusara hai piakra uang ting mih khin khe a-i paw CHAKRAMANG saksing sanara hai sakraura tukla reng kown takla.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Mamaimow: Mamaimow pami dow chang dawngthawng pakat kowh ahua kowng mih hai ahua khuata mih masiuüa kowi kowh tek pe mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Khare: Khare pami dow maru lowk ia kowi peah rukrai kownkow maru pur kowi tek pe naklak mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Prawngren: Prawngren pami dow maru lowk ia lawnguan kowi maru pur kowi iung dowi mih laiklow hai ren lawtla mih laiklow tek mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Ut uakling: Ut uakling pami dow aiukma panow ut iawng ngawng klangma mih uakling kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai. Ut uakling kowh dow ua kowh iawng nawrchawk, khawkmi, alap hai apawi uowi; tawkche ua iawng nowng iow dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem kramra uowima hai akhaw aklaima phaw mih 1:1-11</para>
  <para style="io1">Maru-uüa taphuang angak mih hai chup Thurai mih 1:12-22</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem luk kowi Thurai uang pawla pe ripra mih 2:1-22</para>
  <para style="io1">Pren kowi kowh ta uowi miuüa angak hownia tarip mih hai uowila uiting uangtak mih 3:1-66</para>
  <para style="io1">Juda kowh kung pra kowh khin, kawmat kowh khin hai pur pra kowh nauang ting kown mih khin 4:1-22</para>
  <para style="io1">Nakala saksing sanara kownkow hai pren mih naplan thawpah iawk kownkow chup Thurai mih 5:1-22</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LAM 1" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem sak kowi rau mih</para>
  <para style="s2">Risi tek lai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 1:1" />Uh! Akat khe dow Jerusalem marow kowi maru kawm atekma chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:1">kawmat dow rim lai bowt kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:1">Akat khe dow paprenma maru ringkawah chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:1">kawmat dow mamaimow iawng uang chowng khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:1">Akat khe dow marow maten kowi mang iawng dow lang iuk chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:1">kawmat dow uang chowng nar khai bowt.<verse eid="LAM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 1:2" />Jerusalem marow dow masiuüa iawng uar prowt chi kar khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:2">aia kowh mik tui dow awm kowi uang hawr dawilawi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:2">Aia kowi kowh tangila reng mih pren uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:2">aia kowi napeah sakklamra kown mih miapaw uowi dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:2">Aia kowh auiua maten mih aia kowi kuanah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:2">amatni dow aia kowh ransu uang chowng khai bowt.<verse eid="LAM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 1:3" />Juda maru-uüa dow khawlawt dowi kowi amatni pren towla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:3">amatni dow akeng pren kowi cham uowi nar büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:3">Amatni dow chenchap alangma miuüa tut-e cham uowi khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:3">nalupah kown mih arah paw ka büah dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:3">Krawiah miuüa dow Juda maru-uüa kowi umta lut khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:3">powtla kown mih tiama mapaw ka büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 1:4" />Nauang sun pawi kownkow Thurai chup kim kowi miapaw uang dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:4">Naiawng rakowi Thurai chup kim pra kowh mangla mih tiama dow kar khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:4">Aia tapplawt kowi nakupla kown mih tiama dow akhawma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:4">aia kowh uamowuüa dow nguk runrun khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:4">Thurai chup kim kowi kowh tek meng reng mih malauüa hawmh kar khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:4">Naiawng rakowi Jerusalem dow lainowmma kawm khai.<verse eid="LAM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 1:5" />Jerusalem maru-uüa kowh ransu dow amatni luk kowi chang alow khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:5">amatni kowh ransu-uüa dow amatni luk kowi asowrma uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:5">Amatni kowh dow aprek ahuma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:5">Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG towkah ngare mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:5">Amatni kowh ngeuüa hawmh kowi dow ransu-uüa khümla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:5">ransu-uüa dow nami ngeuüa hawmh kowi pakla khai.<verse eid="LAM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 1:6" />Jerusalem marow kowh dow klangiungra uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:6">aia kowh kiowrira dow ransu-uüa rupta pe khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:6">Aia marow kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow naki iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:6">amatni dow ka taw rah dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:6">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh dow kür uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:6">amatni dow chakmit miuüa pur kowi powt khai bowt.<verse eid="LAM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 1:7" />Jerusalem maru-uüa dow alai kowh amatni iung mih ni ün tuakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:7">kawmat dow angarema hown cham mang panglang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:7">Ransu-uüa rut kowi amatni taap mih khin khe amatni kowi nakhowngah kown mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:7">Amatni kowh ransu-uüa dow tang müah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:7">amatni piak mih dow khi hanow ransu-uüa mih khareah khai.<verse eid="LAM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 1:8" />Jerusalem dow masiuüa ngakma mih iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:8">Naiawng rakowi tasür talawk khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:8">Aia kowh tengiow tengklaima mih dow maru khi pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:8">naiawng kowh ringkawah miuüa maten suiah khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:8">Aia dow rukrai khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:8">Naiawng rakowi petta lumowr now kar khai.<verse eid="LAM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 1:9" />Lup ngak chang hown aiamat dow tasür talawk khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:9">aia kowh angak sung dow tawng chow naown kown mih hing tuak dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:9">Naiawng rakowi aia piak krang dow lainowmma ngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:9">peah sakklamra kown mih miapaw uowi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:9">Aia tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, ransu-uüa dow awng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:9">Naiawng rakowi ang ngare krang uang iu mü diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="LAM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 1:10" />Ransu-uüa dow aia kowh uanh maten pawta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:10">aia kowh uanh asung khakma mih maten dow ransu-uüa rupta pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:10">Akeng chenchapuüa dow Jerusalem marow kowi uang kup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:10">naiawngün dow Jerusalem maru-uüa hawt khi khai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:10">hangah mih chenchapuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kim chimsaima mih kowi kup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:10">naiawngün paw Jerusalem maru-uüa hawt khi khai.<verse eid="LAM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 1:11" />Jerusalem maru maten dow krawi cham chakkham khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:11">amatni dow nguk runrun se krawi cham chak büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:11">Sing kown nau rakowi amatni dow pha chakkham büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:11">amatni kowh asung khakma mih uanh hown chakkham dow phaah büah khai.</para>
  <para style="s2" vid="LAM 1:11">Jerusalem marow tek lai mih</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:11">Aw CHAKRAMANG, mü diah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:11">Maru nü ang dowi mih sam tuak madiah.<verse eid="LAM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 1:12" />Ang ria kowi kowh uowi miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:12">tawngpaw enni ka tuak dowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:12">Sam mü ang büah madiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:12">Ang kowi kowh towk ang mih ngare iawng maru kowi paw towkah tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:12">CHAKRAMANG kunmarau lün pluplup mih khin khe mami ngare dow towk ang mih chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 1:13" />CHAKRAMANG dow aluk hownia uang iu chin ang maih khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:13">nami maih hown ang kowh hut dow kam khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:13">Ang khawk sanra tia kowi aia dow chak ang leng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:13">Naiawng rakowi tawng iawng paw ang ia powt dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:13">Aia dow maru akhawma tow ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:13">ni chut chi auakma hown towta ang hüah khai.<verse eid="LAM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 1:14" />Ang kowh aprek maten aia dow kurdik iawng bat ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:14">aiamat rut hown naiawngün maten dow tapah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:14">Naiawngün dow ang pangkawt kowi tang ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:14">ang kowh kür dow iawta ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:14">Ang nowngah dowi miuüa tut-e aia dow apta ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:14">ang ransu-uüa rut kowi aia dow ap ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 1:15" />CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh tasen kiakma miuüa kowi netta ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:15">ang kowh siphai hawmh kowi aia dow nuata ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:15">Ang kowh klanguüa hawmh kowi aia dow kingküaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:15">nachumta ang kownkow aia dow thawp pe akhin khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:15">Ang maru-uüa kowi dow dita ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:15">sum kowi kowh tung kawm iawng dow tungah khai.<verse eid="LAM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 1:16" />Naiawng rakowi ang kar khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:16">ang kowh mik tui dow awchawng tui iawng uang hawr khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:16">Nape ang sakklamra kown mih miapaw uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:16">nape ang sakkhawtra kown mih paw miapaw uowi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:16">Ransu-uüa dow awng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:16">Naiawng rakowi ang kowh chauüa dow chowng saratchow chah khai bowt.<verse eid="LAM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 1:17" />Ang dow naka khowng kownkow iaw rut khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:17">Tawkche nape ang sakklamra kown mih miapaw uowi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:17">CHAKRAMANG dow ransu-uüa kowi peah ana khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:17">Jerusalem marow kowi naumta lut kownkow peah ana khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:17">Ransu-uüa pungmadawng kowi ang uowi khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:17">asür alawkma mih uanh powm iawng ang chowng khai bowt.<verse eid="LAM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 1:18" />CHAKRAMANG kowh alow pek ang chün dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:18">Naiawng rakowi aia rip ang mih dow mapaw tawi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:18">Chenchapuüa low, sünta diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:18">Ang ngare mih mü büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:18">ang kowh malauüa hawmh dow cham takhang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:18">ang kowh klanguüa hawmh paw alakma kowi cham takhang khai.<verse eid="LAM 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 1:19" />Tangila ang mih prenchakuüa kowi ang hawah chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:19">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow kuan ang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:19">Ang kowh uamowuüa dow krawi cham chakkham khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:19">lawngtang aluchowuüa paw nasingla kownkow krawi cham chakkham khai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:19">tawngpaw ka cha dowi rakowi amatni kowh sak dow chur khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:19">amatni dow marow lak kowi kowng büah khai.<verse eid="LAM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 1:20" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, sam mü ang madiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:20">Lainowmma ang ngare khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:20">ang kingküa en rakowi ang kowh sak piak khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:20">Kim uat kowi dow saidawng hown sak sumra chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:20">kim lak kowi paw kowngra chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 1:21" />Ang kowh nguk klow dow maru maten ta khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:21">Nachenganchepaw nape ang sakklamra kown mih miapaw uowi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:21">En towk ang ngare mih ang ransu-uüa tuk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:21">Naiawng rakowi ransu-uüa dow lainowmma awmrawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:21">Nauang ting kown pahai en phuangah mih ni dow uang pe tingah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:21">amatni paw ang iawng dow pacham tawi own büah bowt lah.<verse eid="LAM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 1:22" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, sam mü madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:22">amatni kowh lup ngak maten sam mü pe madiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:22">Ang kowh angak rakowi en chang ang mih iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:22">amatni kowi paw chang pe diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 1:22">Lainowmma ang nguk ang kar khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 1:22">ang kowh sak mih lainowmma rau khai bowt.<verse eid="LAM 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LAM 2" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem luk kowi CHAKRAMANG ripra</para>
  <para style="s2">Risi tek lai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 2:1" />Uh! Jerusalem marow dow matawng iawng chowbowt chow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:1">Aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kunmaraura hown mumah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:1">CHAKRAMANG dow Israel kowh kraingra kuakta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:1">aia dow mukuang hownia krawng kowi iu kuakta pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:1">Aia kunmarau mih ni khe dow tawngpaw aia tuakla dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:1">aia kowi kowh chupla mih kim khowm padow aia tuakla dowi.<verse eid="LAM 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 2:2" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowh kim maten piakta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:2">Jakawb krungchakuüa kowi mapaw sanaah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:2">Israel pren kowi kowh marow tap paw piakta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:2">aia kowh kunmaraura hown nami dow khueta pe khai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:2">naiawngün dow krawng kowi kuakah now piakta pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:2">Aia kowh pren hai aluchowuüa kowi dow pe rukraiah khai.<verse eid="LAM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 2:3" />Aia kunmarau lün pluplup mih hown siphaiuüa kowi chumta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:3">Israeluüa kowh kür maten dow aia piakta pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:3">Ransu-uüa uang khe aia kowh rut akürma mih dow aia kunta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:3">aia dow nau khowngah dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:3">CHAKRAMANG dow Jerusalem marow klangiungma mih piakta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:3">aia dow Jerusalem marow kowi maih hown towkah khai.<verse eid="LAM 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 2:4" />Ransu dow uüi leba khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:4">nami iawng dow aia kowh rut mih raw anging khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:4">Pe anging awmrawmra miuüa maten kowi aia dow saita anging khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:4">Aia kowh kunmaraura dow maih iawng lün pluplup khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:4">Nami dow Jerusalem marow luk kowi kowklai pe khai.<verse eid="LAM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 2:5" />CHAKRAMANG dow ransu iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:5">aia dow Israeluüa kowh pren kowi piakta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:5">Aia dow Israel kowi kowh kim aiukma mih ün piakta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:5">now akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim maten paw piakta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:5">Aia dow Jerusalem marow kowi karra uang pe huah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:5">marow klangiungma mih kowi ngukra aia uang pe huah khai.<verse eid="LAM 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 2:6" />Te dow aiachow maru ia piak reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:6">nami iawng CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowi kowh chupla mih kim piakah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:6">Jerusalem marow kowi kowh pawi maten pe tamata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:6">Tanai Ni lawnguan kowi paw aia dow pe tamata khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:6">Kramra uowima mih kunmaraura hown manguüa kowi nuata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:6">uamowuüa kowi paw aia dow nuata khai.<verse eid="LAM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 2:7" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh phuchuara nuata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:7">aia kowi kowh chupla mih kim hownia aia dow powt khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:7">Aia kowi kowh chupla mih kim tap maten dow ransu-uüa rut kowi apta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:7">ransu-uüa dow awng khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:7">Naiawng rakowi pawi ni khe kowh kiow Thurai mih klow iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:7">aia kowi kowh chupla mih kim kowi ransu-uüa how khai.<verse eid="LAM 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 2:8" />Jerusalem marow klangiungma mih dow napiakta kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:8">CHAKRAMANG kamrütah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:8">Aia dow napiakah kownkow kaneuma kamrüt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:8">now napiakah kownkow aia rut kowi pe tanaiah dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:8">Jerusalem kowi kowh tap hai khah dow takhue now chan bunlun khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:8">naiawngün dow tapiak bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 2:9" />Aia kowh tapplawt ün dow bawn hai tathia khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:9">aklia müa ün paw klowkta pe khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:9">Aia kowh manguüa dow akeng pren kowi cham takhang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:9">aia kowh aluchowuüa paw cham takhang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:9">CHAKRAMANG rirow pami tawngpaw tuk büah dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:9">Aia kowh risiuüa paw CHAKRAMANG hownia ka mukmang dowi bowt.<verse eid="LAM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 2:10" />Kowng miuüa kowi uowila uiting uangtak mih natüngla büah kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:10">Jerusalem kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa mih khup sala uan khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:10">Amatni dow lu kowi prui dinchow büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:10">now rarimma bawn kowi chowm büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:10">Kowng miuüa kowi uowila uiting uangtak mih natüngla büah kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:10">Jerusalem malauüa hawmh paw krawng kowi tabawk büah khai.<verse eid="LAM 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 2:11" />Ang kar lai bowt kowh ang kowh mik ri khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:11">now ang saktuak paw pusa khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:11">Ang maru-uüa dow chum khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:11">naiawng rakowi ang kowh kow mih lainowmma uak khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:11">Jerusalem kowi kowh ngeuüa hawmh dow maw kliplip khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:11">marow akuangma rah kowi maw kowh takuakla klip khai.<verse eid="LAM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 2:12" />Ngeuüa hawmh dow amatni u-uüa kowi tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:12">“Chakkham tawng kowi chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:12">Amatni dow marow akuangma mih rah kowi takuakla klip khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:12">amatni dow ka arau mih iawng maw kowh takuakla klip khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:12">Amatni kowh chownglawng dow chur khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:12">amatni u-uüa tut-e tapai se amatni dow kowng khai.<verse eid="LAM 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 2:13" />Aw Jerusalem, aw Jerusalem marow klangiungma mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:13">tawng iawng chow ang natek en bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:13">nape en sakkhawtra kownkow tawng chow ang nachang en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:13">matawng hown chow ang natuh en kown chow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:13">En kowh arau dow sata iawng aiukma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:13">amiapaw nowng rawh en dowi bowt.<verse eid="LAM 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 2:14" />En kowh risiuüa dow ka mukmang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:14">tawkchedow naiawngün mih daila hai alowlowma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:14">Amatni dow en kowh aprek tüng en dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:14">naiawng rakowi takhangra hownia en khalat dowi tham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:14">Pur pra kowh nauang ting kown mih lai tek en mih dow adai chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:14">nami dow tiama tawi kowi pakla en mih chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 2:15" />En ria iawng mang miuüa dow khare en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:15">amatni dow khi en hanow chit en iangdak büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:15">Jerusalem piak mih dow ransu-uüa khi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:15">amatni dow khi hanow prawng renah khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:15">now, “Mami chowbowt nadowi bow marow lang klangiung mih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:15">palusama maru awmrawmah mih?” padow prawngah büah khai.<verse eid="LAM 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 2:16" />Ransu-uüa maten dow kingküa en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:16">amatni dow tek en naklak khai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:16">prawngren en hai krit iüng se tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:16">“Paimi kowi anging piakta khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:16">Mami ni nakhi kownkow anging chawngah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:16">Nami dow anging khi khai bowt,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="LAM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 2:17" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kamrüt mih powm iawng chang lup khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:17">aia dow alai kowh aia tekta iawng changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:17">aia tekta khowk mih lai dow uang pe tachiah khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:17">Aia dow sana en dowi kowi kuakta en khai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:17">ransu kowi dow en luk kowi pe awmrawmah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:17">En ransu-uüa kowi dow aia pe kürah ngamlam khai.<verse eid="LAM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 2:18" />Aw Jerusalem marow klangiungma mih kowi kowh maru-uüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:18">CHAKRAMANG tut-e kar büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:18">Enni kowh mik tui ni chut uar prowt pacham hawr lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:18">enni kowh mik tui mih tap hownia pacham ue lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:18">Enni matia kowi hangkow peah sakklamra diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:18">mik kowi paw hangkow pe tanaiah diah.<verse eid="LAM 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 2:19" />Rü hanow uar prowt chi CHAKRAMANG tut-e kar büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:19">enni sakdawng kowi kowh laiklow maten tek pe büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:19">Enni kowh chauüa dow lainowmma hawm sakkrai khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:19">Naiawng rakowi tiama prek towng maw now tim khai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:19">amatni kowh asak naplaila kownkow chup Thurai büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:19">chawk rut se CHAKRAMANG kowi kowphuang pe büa diah.<verse eid="LAM 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Jerusalem marow tek lai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 2:20" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, mü diah, sam tuak madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:20">maiawng hown amia kowi chow en changah mih uowi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:20">Masiuüa hawmh dow amatni kumah mih nau kowi nachaah kown bow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:20">amatni thumah mawmah mih chauüa kowi nachata kown chekhai bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:20">En kowh kim chimsaima kowi uamowuüa kowi saita kown chekhai bow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:20">risiuüa kowi paw napawta pe asak kown chekhai bow?<verse eid="LAM 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 2:21" />Ngeuüa uak dow dinchow dawng kowi takuakla klip khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:21">lawngtanguüa uak dow tiama towng kowi takuakla kan khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:21">Ang kowh malauüa klanguüa hawmh paw kowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:21">amatni dow saidawng hown kowng büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:21">En kunmaraura ni khe amatni kowi dow en satah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:21">amatni kowi dow en sanaah dowi kowi en kowngta khai.<verse eid="LAM 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 2:22" />Pawi ni khe dow en kua maru kawm reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:22">nami powm iawng ang riaret kowi maiow maiow kramra en kua ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:22">CHAKRAMANG kunmaraura ni khe dow miapaw ia powt dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:22">ia plawplai mih amiapaw uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 2:22">Ang thum mawmah mih chauüa kowi ransu-uüa uang piakta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 2:22">ang sakrauah mih chauüa kowi ransu-uüa kowngta ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LAM 3" />
  <para style="s">Thurai ripra</para>
  <para style="s2">Risi tek lai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 3:1" />Ang dow CHAKRAMANG ripah mih maru chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:1">aia kunmarau rakowi kowh ripah mih maru ang na khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 3:2" />Aia dow anowi hownia prütta ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:2">nahanow iiu dawng kowi pe mang ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 3:3" />Ni chut chi aia rut hown bawp ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:3">aplan aplan aia dow bawp ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 3:4" />Ang kowh pik hai nga paw sekta ang nak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:4">ang kowh hut paw klowkta ang nak khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 3:5" />Saktuak kawmkratma hai ngarera thawngrum kowi tow ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:5">aia dow klungta ang hüah khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 3:6" />Kowng khowk miuüa iawng aia dow tow ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:6">aiiuma mih dawng kowi aia dow pe uowi ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 3:7" />Ang ia powtla dowi kownkow tavir lut aia dow kawm ang khah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:7">now kri leng adikma mih hown tawm ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 3:8" />Khowng ang kownkow kar se ang hawah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:8">Nami khin khe paw aia dow nau sünta ang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 3:9" />Ang kowh lawtra tia dow huaklu aiukma mih hown pitta ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:9">ang kowh tiama dow kuita ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 3:10" />Aia dow tawm iawng pawm ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:10">krangsi iawng dow chawm ang kown nau khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 3:11" />Tiama hownia iuala ang now dita ang nak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:11">now aia dow towla ang hüah khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 3:12" />Aia kowh leba dow vüiah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:12">now aia kowh leba sek manra changla ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 3:13" />Aia kowh leba sek rowng hownia leba sek mih aia pawah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:13">now ang kowh sak-uih mih aia pruata ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 3:14" />Ang maru-uüa maten dow prawngren ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:14">ang lawnguan kowi ni chut chi küala rensi büah khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 3:15" />Nowng khamah dowi mowr pe ngare ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:15">ngare krang churma pe kham ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 3:16" />Huaklu kowi letta ang iüng bowk mih iawng towk ang ngare khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:16">Dinchow dawng kowi rowt ang lumowr mih iawng pe rukrai ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 3:17" />Asowr pami ang tut-e uowi dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:17">awmrawmra pami khowm ang tamata tüng khowk.<verse eid="LAM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 3:18" />Naiawng rakowi ang tatek mih, “Ang kowh kür uowi dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:18">CHAKRAMANG tut-e ang kowh sakowmra uowi mih paw khowk khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="LAM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 3:19" />Ang ngare mih hai ang cham mang panglang mih krang ang ka tuak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:19">ang kowh chownglawng angakma mih dow ang tuakah hanow lainowmma ang kawm khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 3:20" />Nami dow atungma ang ka tuak khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:20">Naiawng rakowi ang sak lak kowi lainowmma rau khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 3:21" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG sakraura ang ka tuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:21">naiawngün ang ka tuak hanow ang kowh sakowmra uowi reng.<verse eid="LAM 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai luk kowi sakowmra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 3:22" />CHAKRAMANG kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura rakowi anging tapiak dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:22">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowh sanara dow katpaw achur uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LAM 3:23" />Aia kowh sanara dow rau towng asar hown uang tatüng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:23">aia kowh kaah sakowm mih rah dow akraingma chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LAM 3:24" />Sakdawng kowi ang tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG klen kowi ang kowh miapaw lang uowi dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:24">naiawng rakowi aia luk kowi taih ang naowmsak kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="LAM 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LAM 3:25" />CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak hai owmsak miuüa dow aiungma uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:25">amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG peah iungra reng chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LAM 3:26" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kunma thawngma hawt chawng mih lang iung chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:26">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow amatni kowi nalawngah kown.<verse eid="LAM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LAM 3:27" />Asowmchow hownia tapring tahawi büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:27">nami dow maru vüi nowm nowm iung chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LAM 3:28" />CHAKRAMANG pringhawi mih khin nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:28">nami khin khe aia malowkchow rarimma pacham chowm phülü lah.<verse eid="LAM 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LAM 3:29" />Aia dow khamsum khamdawma hai pacham uowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:29">sakowmra uowi chepaw naia.<verse eid="LAM 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LAM 3:30" />Phekah miia tut-e dow pacham towng pe ngeupa lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:30">rukraira dow atekma pacham kham lah.<verse eid="LAM 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LAM 3:31" />CHAKRAMANG kowh dow sanara atekma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:31">aia dow achowngma vüi lusa maru kowi powtta dowi.<verse eid="LAM 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LAM 3:32" />Aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai sanara dow akraingma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:32">Naiawng rakowi pe ripra chepaw aia dow pe lawtra reng.<verse eid="LAM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LAM 3:33" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru ngare mih aia dow nau dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:33">maru kawmkrat mih paw aia dow awmrawm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LAM 3:34" />Pren kowi kowh kla thawng miuüa kowi krawi chang nowng mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:34">CHAKRAMANG mapaw naukhi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LAM 3:35" />Thurai lang kraing mih kowi kram dowi hai maru kowh alow peah dowi mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:35">CHAKRAMANG mapaw nowng mü dowi chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LAM 3:36" />Maru kowi tara nowm chet pe dowi mih ün,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:36">CHAKRAMANG lainowmma sui khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LAM 3:37" />CHAKRAMANG che peah alow dowi hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:37">amatia tekta iawng mia chow nowng chang mih uowi?<verse eid="LAM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LAM 3:38" />Thurai lang kraing mih low hown nadowi pabow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:38">aiung angak a-i chownglawng kowi uang ting mih?<verse eid="LAM 3:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LAM 3:39" />Sing uowi reng tak khe changta angak rakowi ka ripra hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:39">tawngplawng kowchow maru mih cham chawk lai khai?<verse eid="LAM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angak tatukra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LAM 3:40" />Chu madiah! A-i kowh chowm krang uowi krang sam tuakah madiah sik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:40">now CHAKRAMANG tut-e i plan bowt lah.<verse eid="LAM 3:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LAM 3:41" />Chu madiah! I chawk rut madiah sik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:41">saktuak prawngma hown mukuang Thurai tut-e i tek lah:<verse eid="LAM 3:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LAM 3:42" />“Anging chang ngak khai, anging kingküa en khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:42">en lawt anging dowi bowt.<verse eid="LAM 3:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LAM 3:43" />En kunmaraura hown en krawi anging khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:43">sana dowi kowi en sai anging khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LAM 3:44" />Anging kowh prasi lük dow en tut-e uang ia tingla dowi kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:44">uangnim hown en tatung khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LAM 3:45" />En dow chenchapuüa tut-e sürlawi iawng changla anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:45">now mawngchawng iawng chenchapuüa tut-e en changla anging khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LAM 3:46" />Anging kowh ransu-uüa maten dow kingküa anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:46">amatni dow prawngren anging khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LAM 3:47" />Kramra hai takrow takraira kowi anging uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:47">piakra kowi anging uowi khai,” padow i tek diah sik.<verse eid="LAM 3:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LAM 3:48" />Ang maru-uüa dow piak bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:48">Naiawng rakowi ang mik hownia dow tui uang hawr khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49-50" style="v" sid="LAM 3:49-50" />CHAKRAMANG mih uang iu mü dowi mowr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:49-50">mukuang pren hownia uang iu khi dowi mowr,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 3:49-50">ang mik hownia mik tui nauang hawr reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:49-50">mapaw mowt kown nadowi.<verse eid="LAM 3:49-50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LAM 3:51" />Ang kowh marow kowi masiuüa maten kham ngare mih ang khi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:51">nami ang khi hanow lainowmma ang sak kowi rau khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LAM 3:52" />Uakling kowi ap-ah mih iawng dow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:52">aiawnglowma ransu-uüa ap ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LAM 3:53" />Amatni dow napawta ang asak kownkow kuam lak kowi kuak ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:53">amatni dow huaklu hown nümla ang hüah khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LAM 3:54" />Tui dow limta ang khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:54">ang ka tuak mih, “Ang kowng chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="LAM 3:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LAM 3:55" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, nami kuam abüpma mih hownia ang haw en khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:55">nami khin khe ang hawk klow mih en sünta ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:55" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LAM 3:56" />Ang tek en mih, “Khowng ang kownkow en tut-e ang nauang lü kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:56">nami khin khe hangkow pitta param diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="LAM 3:56" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LAM 3:57" />Ang haw en mih khin khe en uang tatawnah hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:57">“Hangkow kram diah” padow en tek ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:57" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai tut-e chawk lai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LAM 3:58" />Aw CHAKRAMANG en tangila ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:58">ang kowh sak en uang lawng ang khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:58" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LAM 3:59" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang luk kowi kowh chang anowng mih dow en khi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:59">tara anowmma mih chet ang diah.<verse eid="LAM 3:59" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LAM 3:60" />Tawng iawng chow amatni sat klai mih en khi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:60">kingküa ang kownkow amatni tatowngpang mih ün paw en khi chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 3:60" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LAM 3:61" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, amatni prawngren ang mih laiklow en ta chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:61">kingküa kownkow amatni tatowngpang mih laiklow maten paw en ta chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 3:61" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LAM 3:62" />Ni chut chi tatek laisin büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:62">kingküa ang kown mih laiklow kangowh tatek büah khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:62" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LAM 3:63" />Sam mü madiah, satlawt hownia satkup mowr</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:63">amatni dow küala ang rensi büah khai.<verse eid="LAM 3:63" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LAM 3:64" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, amatni kowh angak sung peah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:64">amatni kowh lup sung dow peah diah.<verse eid="LAM 3:64" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LAM 3:65" />Amatni kowh sakowmra uowi dowi pat chang pe diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:65">amatni luk kowi en kowh piati pacham kla lah.<verse eid="LAM 3:65" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LAM 3:66" />Aw CHAKRAMANG en kunmaraura hown amatni kowi krawiah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 3:66">amatni kowi dow mukuang dak hownia mata diah.<verse eid="LAM 3:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LAM 4" />
  <para style="s">Piak kung kowi kowh Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="s2">Risi tek lai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 4:1" />Kuh kowh anowi tawk mih dow tama khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:1">kuh achangma mih dow taklowi khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:1">Asung khakma mih hua ün tauet khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:1">tiama kui towng kowi krawi tauet khai bowt.<verse eid="LAM 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 4:2" />Pakat khe dow Jerusalem marow kowh chapauüa kuh iawng chowdiah</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:2">amatni dow asung khakma chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:2">kawmat dow puh thawp miuüa thawpah mih puh iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:2">bawn puh iawng dow amatni kowi changla khai bowt.<verse eid="LAM 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 4:3" />Brenkhui hawmh khowm padow amatni kowh chauüa kowi iawnah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:3">Nachenganchepaw ang maru-uüa dow naiawng nadowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:3">Amatni dow sangching khawmma mih <char style="w">ut uakling</char> iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:3">amatni dow amatni kowh chauüa kowi khowm mingah khetah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 4:4" />Amatni kowh chauüa dow lainowmma tui sakkrai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:4">sakkrai lai bowt kowh kraw kang khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:4">Ngeuüa hawmh dow lü hawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:4">Nachenganchepaw miapaw peah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 4:5" />Pakat khe kowh aiung aiung cha miuüa dow kowng khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:5">amatni dow hawm khawr hown tiama towng kowng khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:5">Sowmchow hownia asung khakma mih uanh khup miuüa dow plawi dawng kowi mawk khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:5">amatni dow kawmat mawngchawng dawng kowi mawk khai bowt.<verse eid="LAM 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 4:6" />Amiapaw kakah dowi kowi amaisang Sawdawm marow dow piak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:6">Sawdawm marow angakma mih kowi kowh ripah mih lak-e ang maru-uüa kowh ripra lang ngah khai.<verse eid="LAM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 4:7" />Amatni ruiah mih aluchowuüa dow nang lak-e khowm anowi tawk chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:7">now iawn tui lak-e khowm lang kaw chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:7">Amatni dow kow iungma chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:7">now amatni dow kür paw akürma chowdiah.<verse eid="LAM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 4:8" />Nachepaw kawmat dow puh lawi lak-e khowm lang num büah khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:8">tiama kowi amiapaw tuk matah dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:8">Amatni kowh pik dow hut kowi taiap khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:8">singh iawng dow amatni kowh pik paw keu khai bowt.<verse eid="LAM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 4:9" />Khown hown kowng mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:9">tasenra kowi alenma kowng mih lang iung.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:9">Ang maru-uüa dow khawr chakkham khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:9">hawm sakkrai hown kowng ngialia büah khai.<verse eid="LAM 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 4:10" />Chah kowi sakrauma mih u-uüa dow amatni chauüa kowi engah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:10">ang maru-uüa piakra kowi uowi mih khin khe amatni chauüa dow chowng amatni kowh chakkham khai.<verse eid="LAM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 4:11" />CHAKRAMANG mih mapaw aia sak-ih dowi mih dow lawtta bowk khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:11">aia kowh kunmarau lün pluplup mih dow uang iu khükah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:11">Zaiawn kowi dow maih hown aia towkah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:11">nakowi kowh achüng ün pat towkta pe khai.<verse eid="LAM 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 4:12" />Jerusalem kowi ransu-uüa nowng kup kown mih manguüa owm dowi chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:12">tapplawt hownia ransu-uüa nowng kup kown pami lusa kowi kowh maru miapaw owm dowi chowdiah.<verse eid="LAM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 4:13" />Naiawngün phaw mih dow risiuüa hai uamowuüa rakowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:13">aia kowh risiuüa dow chang angak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:13">now aia kowh uamowuüa paw chang lup ngak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:13">Amatni dow marow kowi sai maru iung büah khai.<verse eid="LAM 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 4:14" />Naiawng rakowi risiuüa hai uamowuüa dow mikdu-uüa iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:14">tiama towng cham mang panglang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:14">Amatni dow lainowmma vi hown tasür talawk khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:14">amiapaw amatni kowh uanh khowm kak kown nau dowk.<verse eid="LAM 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 4:15" />Naiawng kowh maru-uüa dow, “Lang süt, enni asür alawkma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:15">Lang süt, lang süt, hauang kak anging,” padow atünma tek büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:15">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow pren towng kowi cham powtla pang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:15">Tawkchedow amatni kowi miapaw pe uowiah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 4:16" />Amatni kowi uetah mih dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:16">aia dow amatni luk kowi pe pe ching dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:16">Uamowuüa kowi miapaw ringkawah dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:16">lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi paw miapaw sanaah dowi bowt.<verse eid="LAM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Jerusalem maru-uüa kar mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 4:17" />Naka khowng kownkow aiawnglowma anging tang mü khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:17">anging kowh mik dow ri khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:17">nowng lawng anging kown nadowi mih chenchap prakowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:17">anging dow hing tang müta hüah chowdiah.<verse eid="LAM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 4:18" />Ransu-uüa dow krawi lim anging khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:18">Naiawng rakowi tawng kowi paw anging cham ia len dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:18">Anging kowh chur khin dow uang tawn khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:18">anging kowh ni ün dow khowk khai bowt.<verse eid="LAM 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 4:19" />Uang krawi anging miuüa dow lainowmma len khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:19">mukuang kowi kowh uamu lak-e lang len büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:19">Amatni dow hungh towng kowi krawi anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:19">now süngrüp süngkangma kowi uang krawi lim anging khai.<verse eid="LAM 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 4:20" />CHAKRAMANG kloah mih mang, anging kowh sakowmra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:20">aia dow ransu-uüa leng kowi cham tasowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:20">Thaulangma uowi kownkow aia luk kowi chowdiah anging owmsak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:20">akeng chenchapuüa hownia nalawng anging kown mih anging sakowmah chowdiah.<verse eid="LAM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 4:21" />Uz pren kowi kowh Edawm maru-uüa low, kawmat piaw büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:21">anging kowh ransu-uüa low, kawmat awmrawm büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:21">Thurai kunmaraura enni luk kowi paw nauang ting kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:21">now enni paw narukrai kown.<verse eid="LAM 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 4:22" />Zaiawn maru-uüa low, enni kowh ripra dow nachur bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:22">aia dow takhangra kowi towta enni hüah dowi bowt tham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 4:22">Nachenganchepaw Edawm maru-uüa low, enni kowh angak ripra nape enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 4:22">enni kowh aprek dow naphuang enni bowt kown.<verse eid="LAM 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LAM 5" />
  <para style="s">Amatni ngare mih krang Thurai kowi chawk pe mih</para>
  <para style="s2">Jerusalem maru-uüa chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 5:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG anging luk kowi tawng chow own mih sam tuak madiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:1">anging ka rukrai mih sam mü madiah.<verse eid="LAM 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 5:2" />Anging vüi bak dow prenlang maru kowi peta khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:2">anging kowh kim üa dow akeng chenchapuüa kowh chowng khai bowt.<verse eid="LAM 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 5:3" />Anging chowng saratchow chah khai, anging kowh pa uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:3">anging kowh u-uüa paw chowng mamaimow khai bowt.<verse eid="LAM 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 5:4" />Khamah kown mih tui anging ran kla khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:4">pe pe asung khü che sawp paw anging ka iang.<verse eid="LAM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 5:5" />Krawi anging miuüa dow anging tut-e uang tatawn khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:5">lainowmma anging bowm khai, mapaw ka tanai dowi chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 5:6" />Chakkham alawkma kala kownkow maru low kowi anging cham uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:6">Aigupta hown Asuria pren nimkrüa kowi anging cham uowi khai.<verse eid="LAM 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 5:7" />Anging kowh pipu-uüa chang angak khai; kawmat amatni dow uowi dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:7">Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh ripra dow anging ta kur khai.<verse eid="LAM 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 5:8" />Naruüa dow anging luk kowi chang alow khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:8">amatni rut hownia lawng anging kown mih miapaw uowi dowi.<verse eid="LAM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 5:9" />Anging dow singsing kowngkowng anging krawi kram chak reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:9">tawngplawng kowchow panow süngrüp süngkangma kowi maru sai mih uowi chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 5:10" />Hawm sakkrai lai bowt kowh anging krau prang towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:10">Naiawng rakowi anging kowh pik mih sikua iawng adenma towbowt.<verse eid="LAM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 5:11" />Jerusalem masiuüa hawmh kowi dow piakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:11">Juda pren kowi kowh malauüa hawmh maten kowi paw piak pe siri khai.<verse eid="LAM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 5:12" />Maru iukuüa kowi dow tawmah now tarah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:12">lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi dow ringkawah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 5:13" />Klanguüa hawmh kowi dow pe tungah mi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:13">ngeuüa hawmh dow sawp dik kur hown tim bawilawi khai.<verse eid="LAM 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 5:14" />Marow kowi kowh tapplawt kowi lawngtang aluchowuüa chowm dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:14">malauüa hai klanguüa hawmh paw tep tingteng taraw dowi bowt.<verse eid="LAM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 5:15" />Anging kowh piawra uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:15">anging plai mih takcha anging nguk kar khai.<verse eid="LAM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 5:16" />Anging kowh mang lukruk dow lu hownia dowh khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:16">Anging chang angak khai rakowi kramra uowi lai kowbow!<verse eid="LAM 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 5:17" />Naiawng rakowi anging kowh sak paw kawm khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:17">naiawngün maten rakowi anging kowh mik paw chim dowi bowt.<verse eid="LAM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 5:18" />Jerusalem kowi kowh Zaiawn hungh kowi maru akhaw aklaima chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:18">brenkhui hawmh dow nami luk kowi krawi len khai.<verse eid="LAM 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sanara ka kownkow chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 5:19" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, achowngma chowm mang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:19">en kowh mang chowm rah dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="LAM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 5:20" />Achowngma pat en tamata anging kown chekhai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:20">Tawngplawng kowchow khin krama en cham powtta anging khai?<verse eid="LAM 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="LAM 5:21-22" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en che nuata anging tangtang mih nadowi hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:21-22">en che anging luk kowi mapaw sak-ih dowi mih nadowi kowh chalow now</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LAM 5:21-22">en tut-e anging uang ia planla kownkow plankut paw anging iawk diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LAM 5:21-22">Auown khe kowh iawng akri akraingma kutplan pe uowi anging iawk diah.<verse eid="LAM 5:21-22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 5" />
</usx>